---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Schools & Education" description="Professional sound system installation and live audio support for schools across Victoria. Theatre-grade audio solutions for school productions, musicals, and performing arts centres.">
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">Schools & Education</p>
      <h1>Industry-leading sound for <span style="color:var(--color-accent)">schools</span>.</h1>
      <p>Professional sound system installation and live audio support for schools across Victoria. Theatre-grade audio trusted by Australia's top performing arts venues — brought into your school.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Why Choose System Sound for Your School?</h2>

        <h3>Theatre Expertise Built In</h3>
        <p>Our team has over 45 years of experience in musical theatre sound design, working on some of Australia's most iconic productions. We bring that expertise directly into your school hall or performing arts centre — giving students and staff access to world-class sound production tools and practices.</p>

        <h3>Learning & Career Pathways</h3>
        <p>We don't just supply equipment. We work alongside drama teachers, AV coordinators, and music departments to offer student training, work experience opportunities, and career mentorship in live sound and production. Several of our student collaborators have gone on to professional sound engineering careers in touring theatre and commercial AV.</p>

        <h3>Tailored to Your Venue</h3>
        <p>From school halls to purpose-built theatres, we design and install custom audio systems for schools of all sizes. Our range includes Meyer Sound systems, Sennheiser wireless microphone kits, and full-stage monitoring solutions. We focus on long-term value, ease of use, and broadcast-quality performance.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="card-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr))">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Speaker Systems</h3>
          <p>From compact point-source speakers to full line arrays. Systems designed for your specific hall, theatre, or outdoor space. Meyer Sound, L-Acoustics, and more.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Wireless Microphones</h3>
          <p>Sennheiser and Shure wireless systems — handheld, lapel, and headset. Pre-tuned, frequency-coordinated, and ready for your production.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Mixing Consoles</h3>
          <p>DiGiCo, Allen & Heath, Yamaha digital consoles. From compact desks for assemblies to full-scale theatre control surfaces.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Training & Mentorship</h3>
          <p>Hands-on workshops for students and staff. Learn from working theatre professionals. Real-world skills in live sound engineering.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Installation & Commissioning</h3>
          <p>Permanent installations designed for your space. Full commissioning, tuning, and user training. Ongoing support and maintenance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Production Support</h3>
          <p>Need a crew for your musical? We can provide operators, technicians, and support staff for school production seasons.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Ready to upgrade your school's sound?</h2>
      <p>Whether it's a simple mic setup for assemblies or a fully integrated system for musicals — let's talk.</p>
      <a href="/sales-enquiry-request" class="btn btn-primary">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
